WEBVTT

00:04:27.513 --> 00:04:30.725
that these videos really helped
mitigate their climate anxiety,

00:04:30.725 --> 00:04:33.352
that they looked forward
to these videos week after week

00:04:33.352 --> 00:04:37.440
and that these videos helped turn
their anger and anxiety into action.

00:04:38.024 --> 00:04:39.317
So I continued making them.

00:04:39.817 --> 00:04:42.695
And in the process of finding
good news stories to share,

00:04:42.695 --> 00:04:44.322
I began to pick up on trends.

00:04:45.281 --> 00:04:46.282
Week after week,

00:04:46.282 --> 00:04:48.451
institutions were divesting
from fossil fuels.

00:04:49.076 --> 00:04:50.077
Week after week,

00:04:50.077 --> 00:04:52.288
land was given back
to Indigenous communities.

00:04:52.413 --> 00:04:53.581
And week after week,

00:04:53.581 --> 00:04:57.043
states were implementing
renewable energy standards.

00:04:58.169 --> 00:05:01.672
I never overlooked the scientific
projections or data,